&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-18626229-give-1000-in-usage-credits-to-every-new-claude-code-or-cowork-user-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-18626229-give-1000-in-usage-credits-to-every-new-claude-code-or-cowork-user-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Give $1,000 in usage credits to every new Claude Code or Cowork user&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
